/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (Matching Point is a retail clothing and household utility store located on Powerhouse Road, Maripur, Muzaffarpur, Bihar, established on 19 May 2014. The store is a B2C business that has been serving local customers for over ten years. It offers a wide range of products including lungi, undergarments, sarees, blouses, suit pieces, matching dupattas, saaya \(petticoat\), leggings, plazo, pant-plazo, and several other matching accessories across multiple varieties.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
89 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (The key business problems identified are: \(1\) the absence of a structured method to evaluate which product categories generate the most revenue and \(2\) the inability to track customer demand patterns across product categories, which leads to inefficient inventory planning and stock management decisions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
