/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (Matching Point is a B2C retail clothing and household utility store located on Powerhouse Road, Maripur, Muzaffarpur, Bihar, situated in front of Trome Hospital. The store was established on 19 May 2014 and has been operating in the local retail market for more than ten years. The store is open from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM on all working days and is managed by its owner along with one to two supporting staff members.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
92 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (The store offers a diverse product range including lungi, undergarments, sarees, blouses, suit pieces, matching dupattas, saaya \(petticoat\), leggings, plazo, pant-plazo, mosquito nets, and various matching accessories. Each product category includes multiple varieties to cater to different customer preferences. The business primarily serves customers from nearby residential and commercial areas through direct walk-in retail sales. Product selection and inventory decisions are currently based on the owner's personal experience and market observation rather than any systematic data analysis.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
