/T (For Problem Statement 1 \(Working Capital\): The analysis will identify specific slow-moving garment categories that contribute to locked working capital. The resulting data-backed discounting and stock-clearing recommendations will directly help reduce inactive inventory, improve turnover rates, and enhance daily cash flow management. )
